WEBVTT

00:06:59.660 --> 00:07:01.826
ki smo jo identificirali
v Fisherjevi študiji.

00:07:02.686 --> 00:07:07.771
Tako me je Penijean nekajkrat

00:07:07.795 --> 00:07:09.669
povezala s svojimi elektrodami

00:07:10.573 --> 00:07:13.799
in mi razložila, da mi ni treba
nič narediti in nič misliti.

00:07:13.823 --> 00:07:16.390
V bistvu sem morala samo biti mirna

00:07:16.414 --> 00:07:18.273
in ostati budna

00:07:18.297 --> 00:07:19.575
in gledati.

00:07:21.791 --> 00:07:25.614
(zvoki harfe in vibrafona)

00:07:25.638 --> 00:07:27.279
In sem.

00:07:27.303 --> 00:07:30.262
Vsakič, ko so moji možgani
operirali v zdravi mejni vrednosti,